  "analysis_md": "令 $u_x+v_x=2x+2y-5$，$u_y+v_y=-2y+2x-5$，再联立 $u_x=v_y$、$u_y=-v_x$，积分可得 $u=x^2-5x-y^2+c_0$，$v=2xy-5y-c_0$，所以 $f(z)=z^2-5z+(1-i)c_0$。",
